     "settings": {
      "html": "<ul class=\"d2u-list\"><li><strong>Fitness Training</strong><br>Guided movement and strength practices you can carry into daily life.</li><li><strong>Nutrition Basics</strong><br>Practical, culturally aware nutrition that fits your routine.</li><li><strong>Mindfulness & Stress</strong><br>Breathing, meditation, and recovery tools that reduce burnout.</li><li><strong>Mental Health Literacy</strong><br>Recognizing signs, support pathways, and protective routines.</li><li><strong>Community Wellness</strong><br>Bring what you learn back to family, team, and neighborhood.</li></ul>"
